{
  "runId": "fe448cfc-aa6e-4089-a3f6-79fb9a3522b4",
  "status": "answered",
  "question": "According to Bohdan Opryshko in his CCN interview, how did Everstake keep operations resilient during the war in Ukraine?",
  "text": "In his CCN interview, Bohdan Opryshko stated that when the war began, Everstake temporarily put all other company operations on hold to focus on helping Ukraine and determining what needed to be done for their home. [4dd48a44d7d8f8dcb3a4cbf9e6fd2771]\n\nOpryshko explained that partner networks across roughly 60 proof-of-stake or delegated proof-of-stake networks operated by Everstake\u2014such as the Ethereum Foundation, Solana Foundation, and Cardano\u2014reached out immediately to confirm team safety and offer assistance. [4dd48a44d7d8f8dcb3a4cbf9e6fd2771]\n\nBecause traditional banks were closed and unable to process donations, Everstake utilized its connections with Ukraine's Ministry of Digital Transformation to create a bridge connecting cryptocurrency to the National Bank of Ukraine to convert crypto into Ukrainian hryvnia. [4dd48a44d7d8f8dcb3a4cbf9e6fd2771]",
  "asOf": "2026-04-23",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In his CCN interview, Bohdan Opryshko stated that when the war began, Everstake temporarily put all other company operations on hold to focus on helping Ukraine and determining what needed to be done for their home.",
      "citations": [
        "4dd48a44d7d8f8dcb3a4cbf9e6fd2771"
      ],
      "asOf": "2026-04-23"
    },
    {
      "text": "Opryshko explained that partner networks across roughly 60 proof-of-stake or delegated proof-of-stake networks operated by Everstake\u2014such as the Ethereum Foundation, Solana Foundation, and Cardano\u2014reached out immediately to confirm team safety and offer assistance.",
      "citations": [
        "4dd48a44d7d8f8dcb3a4cbf9e6fd2771"
      ],
      "asOf": "2026-04-23"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because traditional banks were closed and unable to process donations, Everstake utilized its connections with Ukraine's Ministry of Digital Transformation to create a bridge connecting cryptocurrency to the National Bank of Ukraine to convert crypto into Ukrainian hryvnia.",
      "citations": [
        "4dd48a44d7d8f8dcb3a4cbf9e6fd2771"
      ],
      "asOf": "2026-04-23"
    }
  ],
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "4dd48a44d7d8f8dcb3a4cbf9e6fd2771",
      "documentId": "youtube:d8EtzF2qhMM:27359f2c027580d3",
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d8EtzF2qhMM&t=252",
      "title": "Crypto Market Recovery, Ukraine Lessons, And Staking Resilience: Bohdan Opryshko On Geopolitics",
      "text": "[4:12] Bohdan Opryshko, Co-founder and COO at Everstake (company participant; testimony at recording): Yeah, so it's actually was very fun time because I remember that we put on hold all other company operations, and we started working on how we can help Ukraine, how we can help with our own home, and what we have to do. And as soon as the war started, like, next day, more and more people started calling us and asking, like, how I can help you, what I can do, blah, blah, blah. And just because of nature of Everstake, like, Everstake is a staking company, we operate with a different network. So we become, like, good friends, partners, colleagues with Ethereum Foundation, Solana Foundation, Cardano, and all of them, like, working on with the proof of stake or delegated proof of stake. And almost, almost each of these networks, and at that time we operate around, like, 60 networks or so, almost each of these networks contacted us and said, like, are you safe, are all your colleagues safe, how we can help, and so on. It's one point. And another point, we understand that we even cannot donate nothing to Ukraine because banks are not working. It's, like, closed. So that, at that time, just because we have a good connection with the Ministry of Digital Transformation of Ukraine, we set up something like a bridge between Ukraine National Bank and crypto. So we can easily transfer crypto, and then we can transfer into hryvnia, Ukrainian national currency.",
